stateDiagram-v2
 [*] --> READY
 READY --> TASK: Open user task
 READY --> TIMER: Schedule timer job
 READY --> SERVICE: Schedule service job
 READY --> JOIN: Record a branch arrival
 READY --> DONE: Route or reach end
 TASK --> DONE: Claimed task completed
 TIMER --> DONE: Due timer fired
 SERVICE --> DONE: Service commits
 JOIN --> DONE: Every fork branch arrived
 DONE --> [*]
